      "width": 936,
      "height": 382,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "text": "1.  Login by email                                              DONE\n2.  Five slots: 1\u20133 today (at least one), 4 blockers, 5 yesterday comments\n                                                                PARTIAL  (1\u20133 on the form)\n3.  Today\u2019s date by default                                     PARTIAL  (no date picker)\n4.  Shows previous tasks                                        DONE\n5.  Mark completed / in progress / abandoned / not started      PARTIAL\n    (admin cannot rename those phases)\n6.  Skip holidays the admin marked                              DONE\n7.  Skip weekends; admin can add an extra 1\u20135 day               DONE\n8.  Admin adds people one by one (name + email) or Excel        PARTIAL  (no Excel)\n9.  Track skipped dates with no reason                          DONE\n10. Reason required when someone skips                          DONE\n11. Admin sets cutoff and chooses close vs late                 PARTIAL\n    (fixed 9:30 a.m.; cron marks late / missed)\n12. Tasks stay editable                                         PARTIAL  (today yes, past locked)",
      "originalText": "1.  Login by email                                              DONE\n2.  Five slots: 1\u20133 today (at least one), 4 blockers, 5 yesterday comments\n                                                                PARTIAL  (1\u20133 on the form)\n3.  Today\u2019s date by default                                     PARTIAL  (no date picker)\n4.  Shows previous tasks                                        DONE\n5.  Mark completed / in progress / abandoned / not started      PARTIAL\n    (admin cannot rename those phases)\n6.  Skip holidays the admin marked                              DONE\n7.  Skip weekends; admin can add an extra 1\u20135 day               DONE\n8.  Admin adds people one by one (name + email) or Excel        PARTIAL  (no Excel)\n9.  Track skipped dates with no reason                          DONE\n10. Reason required when someone skips                          DONE\n11. Admin sets cutoff and chooses close vs late                 PARTIAL\n    (fixed 9:30 a.m.; cron marks late / missed)\n12. Tasks stay editable                                         PARTIAL  (today yes, past locked)",
      "fontSize": 14,
