      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "text": "Feedback thread on a person\u2019s 1\u20135.     End-of-day close (tick what finished).\n9:30 a.m. auto-close \u2014 late and missed, plus an email digest.     Skip today with a why.\nEmpty slots can be filled from that person\u2019s own work.     1\u20135s show on their department desk,\nnot only on a personal page.     Thursday pulse (wins / risks / help) for the desk.",
      "originalText": "Feedback thread on a person\u2019s 1\u20135.     End-of-day close (tick what finished).\n9:30 a.m. auto-close \u2014 late and missed, plus an email digest.     Skip today with a why.\nEmpty slots can be filled from that person\u2019s own work.     1\u20135s show on their department desk,\nnot only on a personal page.     Thursday pulse (wins / risks / help) for the desk.",
